[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

"Amorphous blobs of cave jelly which, mildly aggressive, move around in caves. They get more common and dangerous the lower you go, but should be very rare on the first cave level. They sometimes appear when mining." -jorb

==Combat==

===Behaviour===

Agrresive in certain radius, immediately attack if mined out.

