===Strategy===

==Notes==

* Can be spawned from [[Loose Rock]] when destroying it or mine around 7 tiles it.
* A Green Ooze will split into 2 Oozes when receive any damage during combat. It is not advised to attack them with weak attacks or weapons, unless you need to multiply them for grind.
* Deep Water can give you a much-needed advantage against groups of Oozes. They can't swim, neither do they have any kind of ranged attack. Player characters can swim, but also (much more preferably) can use [[boat]]s.

